[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5858389008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123894#issuecomment-5858389008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123894","id":5858389008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXS_sEA","user":{"login":"whirlin22","id":45559876,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTU5ODc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45559876?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22","html_url":"https://github.com/whirlin22","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T18:04:49Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T18:04:49Z","body":"[await.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32707574/await.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5858389008/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5858649918","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123894#issuecomment-5858649918","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123894","id":5858649918,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXTPnPg","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T18:40:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T18:42:18Z","body":"> A CanvasLayer node named SceneTransition has a ColorRect of full_screen size. If I instance it as scene_transition and call scene_transition.fade_out(), change the scene, and then scene_transition.fade_in(), I don't see anything because both Tweens fire at approximately the same time. This indicates that the await Tween.finished line doesn't actually wait.\n\nYou're calling both `transition.fade_out()` and `transition.fade_in()` pretty much at the same time, as you're not `await`ing for the `transition.fade_out()` to finish.\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n@onready var transition = $Transition\n@onready var label = $Label\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1).timeout\n\ttransition.fade_out() # <--------------- `await transition.fade_out()` would do what you want.\n\tlabel.text = \"hello\"\n\ttransition.fade_in()\n```\n\nThe behavior is correct and [documented](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.7/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.html#awaiting-signals-or-coroutines), no bug in here, closing.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5858649918/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]